      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  100 Feet (15 foot radius sphere)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Create a blue orb of energy in front of you before launching it to explode at your target. Choose a location within range, and all creatures in a 15 foot radius must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 8d8 <em>Fire Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n",
